iero", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Oliviero0/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 6267, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 998, "last_played": 1707516850, "avatar": "e0cc604685dafcb6c740e1836efc7c1ab6b6dc85"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you don't rock and stone, you ain't comin' home!", "timestamp_created": 1615246209, "timestamp_updated": 1615246209, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "88104822", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140545721", "personaname": "FlyFriend", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198140545721/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 66247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7446, "last_played": 1770482333, "avatar": "d9ff629171e18c02886211870c00b0826d9fd5b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Be me\nUnsuspectingly join a modded lethal lobby with 2x bugs\nAccidentically nuke your teammates a few times\nDie 12 times\nHave zero revives\nGet carried all the way through\nTreat your squad to free beer, cause that you can do\n\nRock and stone!", "timestamp_created": 1615245488, "timestamp_updated": 1615245488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "88104497", "author": {"steamid": "76561198181673422", "personaname": "SageOfSaria", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tbskm/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1355, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 658, "last_played": 1748292318, "avatar": "8f2f5ece5667223f44ab2a279954e26b91aadd5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is honestly such a blast. Funny and charismatic with an extremely tight, satisfying gameplay loop. \n\nOne thing I really love about DRG is that it's lighthearted: you're never competing with your teammates for resources, grinding a stage for hours, or trying to perfect some technique for your class. The devs know what's actually fun and rewarding about the game and optimize for it, resulting in a nearly perfect execution of a great idea. That's not to say the game is shallow; there's enough depth in builds and equipment to keep it interesting, but the devs have miraculously eliminated any learning curve. It's still just as fun for me as it was on my first mission.\n\nIt's also one of the only multiplayer games my wife genuinely enjoys playing, so if you've been looking for a great co-op shooter for non-gamer friends/family, DRG is a very solid bet.", "timestamp_created": 1615244920, "timestamp_updated": 1615244920, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}